# 6. 🏗️ Multi-Stage Docker Builds

Multi-stage builds separate the **build environment** from the **runtime environment**.

```text
Builder Image
      │
      ↓
Compile Application
      │
      ↓
Final Application
      │
      ↓
Small Runtime Image
```

### Benefits

* Smaller images
* Faster deployments
* Fewer unnecessary packages
* Reduced attack surface
* Cleaner production containers

