# 17. 🏗️ Multi-Stage Dockerfile

Example using Go:

```dockerfile
FROM golang:1.25 AS builder

WORKDIR /app

COPY . .

RUN go build -o app


FROM debian:bookworm-slim

WORKDIR /app

COPY --from=builder /app/app .

CMD ["./app"]
```

### Architecture

```text
Stage 1 – Builder
─────────────────
Go Compiler
Build Tools
Source Code
     │
     ↓
Build Application
     │
     ↓
     └──────────────┐
                    ↓
Stage 2 – Runtime
──────────────────
Small Runtime Image
Application Binary
```

### Main Benefit

The final image does not need to contain the compiler and other build tools.

